sequenceDiagram
    participant Rating as Rating service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Kafka as foc.user.rating

    Note over Rating,DB: the rating, user_rating, and outbox row commit in one transaction
    loop every second, and again at once while rows come back
        Rating->>DB: lock up to 100 unsent rows, oldest first, skip locked
        loop each row
            Rating->>Kafka: send, key is the ratee's user id
        end
        alt every send accepted
            Rating->>DB: set sent_at and commit
        else a send fails
            Note over Rating,DB: roll back, the whole batch is sent again on the next pass
        end
    end
    loop hourly
        Rating->>DB: delete rows sent more than 7 days ago
    end
